<title>FINLAND: OKOBANK CEO SEES MORE BANK MERGERS -PAPER.</title>
<headline>OKOBANK CEO SEES MORE BANK MERGERS -PAPER.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish cooperative banking group OKOBANK's CEO Antti Tanskanen expects more mergers and acquisitions in banking, daily Kauppalehti reported on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;I expect mergers in the banking sector,&quot; the paper quoted Tanskanen as saying. It did not specify what if any geographical area he was referring to.</p>
<p>Information technology would boost banking competition and make it possible for other sectors such as retailing to start competing with banks, he said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 242</p>
